## QS Bar ##

This is a simple top bar for Quickshell.
Based on Tony btw's bar.

Usage:

---
git clone https://github.com/rivethorn/qs-bar
cd qs-bar
mkdir ~/.config/quickshell
cp shell.qml ~/.config/quickshell/
---

Then you can either run:

---
quickshell
---

for quick testing, and you can add:

---
hl.exec_cmd("quickshell")
---

to your Hyprland config.
